{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101736","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101736/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101736/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101736/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101736","id":2796626265,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6IN7K6","number":101736,"title":"Improve efficiency and precision of Geometry2D.is_point_in_polygon.","user":{"login":"L4Vo5","id":37083802,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDgzODAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37083802?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5","html_url":"https://github.com/L4Vo5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/L4Vo5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-01-18T03:45:30Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101736","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101736","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101736.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101736.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The previos version called `segment_intersects_segment`, which is less precise as it checks against an epsilon. As far as I can tell, the only inputs for which the result differs is when that imprecision comes into play. \r\nSo, this version also fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/81042 and fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/82305 (at least, the provided reproductions now work)\r\nIt's also about 6x faster, from my (very limited) tests.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis version turned out to be the same concept as was suggested [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/82305#issuecomment-1735498943). It still checks for an odd number of intersections, but instead of using a preliminary loop to finding a point outside the polygon in order to construct a line, it uses an infinite ray from p_point towards (-inf, p_point.y).\r\nIn the intersection calculation, between the ray and every line in the polygon, there are some edge cases that return true for points exactly on the polygon boundary. Otherwise, an intersection can only exist if `p_point.y` is between `v1.y` and `v2.y`. With that knowledge, we can calculate `p = inverse_lerp(v1.y, v2.y, p_point.y)`, a value between 0 and 1. The x of the intersection point between the polygon's line, and the infinite line described by `y = p_point.y`, is `x = lerp(v1.x, v2.x, p)`. If `x <= p_point.x` then there is an intersection. Since we only care about that inequality and don't actually want the exact x of the intersection point, the math can be simplified, and it turns out to basically be a cross product between `p_point - v1` and `v2 - v1`. Which is easier to compute as it avoids a division caused by `inverse_lerp`.\r\nI also replaced a remainder `(%)` with a ternary operation, which also seemed to boost performance slightly.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101736/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101736/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}